Termux terminal-emulator and terminal-view, directly ported from
https://github.com/wsdx233/Love2Droid/tree/df583461887340a1031bfbf7b4fb6ee377750561
Upstream Termux v0.118.0, imported there through r2droid f1c63598688027dcbf4404c27ef14a3893ccb9e1.
These terminal modules are the Apache-2.0 exceptions identified by Termux.
See licenses/TERMUX-TERMINAL-LICENSE.txt and the bundled assets/licenses copy.
WawLink changes: Android SDK/arm64 build settings, runtime-owned Process transport,
public Android PTY Process adapter, native fd/JNI correctness fixes, Chinese exit text.
Terminal reader/writer/waiter failures are contained with process/stream cleanup;
JNI wait failures release callers with status -1, while normal PTY EIO/EOF keeps
the actual shell exit status and session completion is delivered only once.

The Android host and two-row key layout in TerminalSurface.android.kt are adapted
from Love2Droid EditorActivity.kt (setupTerminal/setupTerminalKeys/createTerminalKeyRow)
and activity_editor.xml at the same pinned commit. Black terminal background,
12sp default text, Maple Mono NF CN Regular, 38dp equally weighted keys, 3dp row
spacing, #2D2D2D bar, #424242 keys and #5C6BC0 one-shot modifiers follow that host.
WawLink adds attachment/window-focus InputConnection setup, explicit touch-mode
focus, non-focusable extra keys and runtime-owned teardown; it retains Termux's
hardware input, long-press selection/copy/paste, resize and terminal emulation.

RuntimeIdentity.kt adapts ProotRuntime.hostSupplementaryGroupIds and
ProotInstaller.configureHostGroups from that commit. It appends missing real
Android supplementary GIDs to the PRoot guest's /etc/group at runtime, preserving
existing mappings; no stderr filtering or replacement PRoot engine is used.

The unmodified maple_mono_nf_cn_regular.ttf is copied from that commit's
app/src/main/res/font (Git blob 8461eff46c05f24b245fc9b5e8911bb3fcc26d28).
